  "details": "1. Set Android system language:\n\n      German (Switzerland)\n\n2. open VR Chat *Android* Client\n\n3. View world details\n\n-> Wrong number format:\n\n  Reading: 415'1 \n\n  Should Read (Swiss German Format): 1'415\n\n  one thousand four hundred and fifteen.\n\n(may affect other platforms clients as well)\n\nIMPORTANT: This does NOT affect German (Germany). This only affects the Swiss regional Format. (With the ' as thousands delimitor char)\n\nandroid app ver:\n\nVersion 2025.3.2p1-1696-ce8fdde7e9-Release",
